# RAG Product: AI Knowledge Assistant

## 📌 Project Overview

This project combines the individual components developed during the earlier RAG challenge weeks into a working AI Knowledge Assistant.

The application allows users to ask questions through an API and receive answers grounded in retrieved document chunks, along with source citations.

Unlike a basic chatbot, this system uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to retrieve relevant information before generating an answer.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Combine document chunking, semantic search, metadata filtering, and grounding.
* Build a complete RAG pipeline using Python.
* Expose the pipeline through a FastAPI endpoint.
* Return answers with source citations.
* Evaluate retrieval quality and response quality.
* Add a confidence warning when retrieved context may be insufficient.
* Deploy and test a functional AI endpoint.

